Subject: [PATCH 10/13] ntdll: Opt-in exactly-once release of threadpool I/O
 objects (Highball 0025)

Off by default; the original I/O completion paths run unchanged unless
CALIMOCHO_FIX_THREADPOOL_IO=1. The new tests skip without the flag.
